  "title": "Unique Smoky Mediterranean Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A charred and chewy Mediterranean dish featuring Gruyere, smoked paprika, and lamb, cooked in a copper pot, this recipe is FODMAP friendly and perfect for a show-off dinner party.",
